5043-.
5044-           The PMC register is used to indicate to system software which power management features are
5045:           supported. In the 21285, this register is Read/Write from the SA-110 and Read-Only from the PCI.
5046-           This enables the SA-110 firmware to determine exactly what features of the PCI Power
5047-           Management Interface Specification are supported. The field names from this specification are
5048-           listed here for reference; however, the 21285 does not interpret or use these bits for any
5049-           hardware-specific function, other than register reads and writes.
