6248-        I2O Inbound Free_List Count Register--Offset 130h
6249-
6250-        The contents of the inbound free_list count register contain the number of entries available on the
6251-        I2O inbound free_list. When the SA-110 writes to this address, the action is dependent on the value
6252-        of bit 31 of the data. If 0, the value in the register is incremented by one (disregarding the rest of
6253-        the write data); if 1, the data is written into the register. When a PCI bus master removes an entry
6254-        from the free_list (via a read to offset 40h), the value is decremented by one.
6255-
6256-        Dword Bit  Name                R/W       Description
6257-        15:0                                     I2O inbound free_list count.
