C:\DocumentNoSnc\CC\GXEMUL\GXEMUL-SEC\regress\gate_arm.sh:1088:    #  PER-ROW PASS, one line, checked individually.  A row that silently stops being
C:\DocumentNoSnc\CC\GXEMUL\GXEMUL-SEC\regress\gate_arm.sh-1089-    #  tested is the padded-column class -- a name as long as its column makes the check
