C:\DocumentNoSnc\CC\GXEMUL\GXEMUL-SEC\regress\gate_arm.sh-1430-#  ------------------------------------------------------------ pcc2defaultkill (#501)
C:\DocumentNoSnc\CC\GXEMUL\GXEMUL-SEC\regress\gate_arm.sh-1431-#  The default: arm of DEVICE_ACCESS(pcc2) ended the host on any access to an uncased
C:\DocumentNoSnc\CC\GXEMUL\GXEMUL-SEC\regress\gate_arm.sh:1432:#  offset, reads included.  Now: reads keep the served byte, writes are declined, one
C:\DocumentNoSnc\CC\GXEMUL\GXEMUL-SEC\regress\gate_arm.sh:1433:#  latched announce per offset per instance.  The witness (regress/artifacts/pcc2defaultkill/
