453-1.1  Intel Semiconductor's 21285 is a single-chip interface between an SA-110 microprocessor,
454:     synchronous DRAM memory (SDRAM), read-only memory (ROM), and the PCI bus. It is
455-     designed to support the following three modes of operation:
456-
