codex
None of the existing probe expectations needs to change for a fix limited to these five sites. Repointing K1 would also require updating its `ENABLE SET` diagnostic check; changing the address alone is insufficient.

The leak check needs a new observable: the probe parses `r7` but never asserts its value. Survival and disassembly checks cannot detect a surviving read that still returns the enable mask.

